# A94 (TeraDesk via #Z, sd-tera): the A79 tera-window script, then a second
# double-click on HARD DISC C (195,35 -- the icon row stays visible above the
# first window, whose title starts at y=62) to ask TeraDesk for a second
# directory window; the old top must come out untopped (white name band).
# Ticks are 200 Hz after the first AES pump of the first EL0 program.
200 parkbr
1100 mark A_IDLE
1400 move 195 35
1600 down
1603 up
1608 down
1611 up
2000 parkbr
2600 mark B_ONE_WINDOW
2900 move 195 35
3100 down
3103 up
3108 down
3111 up
3500 parkbr
4100 mark C_TWO_WINDOWS
4500 mark D_TWO_WINDOWS_2S
